            <t:div type="textpart" xml:id="Treatise">
               <t:label>On the Eight Thoughts by Evagrius</t:label>
               
               <t:div type="textpart" xml:id="TreatiseGluttony">
                  <t:label xml:lang="en">On the gluttonous belly <t:foreign xml:lang="gez">በእንተ፡ ሥሡዕ፡ ከርሥ፡</t:foreign></t:label>
                  <t:label>Chapter One</t:label>
                  <t:note>A clear division into chapters, <t:foreign xml:lang="gez">አንቀጽ፡</t:foreign>, is provided only in some manuscripts. Likewise, only in some manuscripts is the chapter number added.</t:note>
               </t:div>
               
               <t:div type="textpart" xml:id="TreatiseAvarice">
                  <t:label>On Love of Gold and Silver <t:foreign xml:lang="gez">በእንተ፡ ፍቅረ፡ ወርቅ፡ ወብሩር፡</t:foreign> </t:label>
                  <t:note>On Avarice</t:note>
                  <t:label>Chapter Two</t:label>
               </t:div>
               
               <t:div type="textpart" xml:id="TreatiseVainglory">
                  <t:label>On Vainglory <t:foreign xml:lang="gez">በእንተ፡ ስብሐት፡ ብጡል፡</t:foreign></t:label>
                  <t:label>Chapter Three</t:label>
               </t:div>
               
               <t:div type="textpart" xml:id="TreatisePride">
                  <t:label>On Pride <t:foreign xml:lang="gez">በእንተ፡ ትዕቢት፡</t:foreign> </t:label>
                  <t:label>Chapter Four</t:label>
            </t:div>
               
               <t:div type="textpart" xml:id="TreatiseFornication">
                  <t:label>On the Unchaste <t:foreign xml:lang="gez">በእንተ፡ ዘማዊ፡</t:foreign></t:label>
                  <t:note>On Fornication</t:note>
                  <t:label>Chapter Five</t:label>
                  <t:note>In some manuscripts Chapter 5 appears after Chapter 6.</t:note>
               </t:div>
               
               <t:div type="textpart" xml:id="TreatiseAnger">
                  <t:label>On Aversion and Anger <t:foreign xml:lang="gez">በእንተ፡ ቍጥዓ፡ ወመዓት፡</t:foreign> </t:label>
                  <t:label>Chapter Six</t:label>
               </t:div>
               
               <t:div type="textpart" xml:id="TreatiseFear">
                  <t:label>On the Fearful <t:foreign xml:lang="gez">በእንተ፡ ፈራህ፡</t:foreign></t:label>
                  <t:label>Chapter Seven</t:label>
               </t:div>
               
               <t:div type="textpart" xml:id="TreatiseRevange">
                  <t:label>On the Sickness of the Heart, the Shell of the Soul: Revenge <t:foreign xml:lang="gez">በእንተ፡ ሕማመ፡ ልብ፡ ዝውእቱ፡ ግላ፡ ነፍስ፡ በቀል፡</t:foreign></t:label>
                  <t:label>Chapter Eight</t:label>
               </t:div>
               <t:div type="textpart" subtype="colophon">  
                  <t:ab>በሰላም፡ ተተርጐመ፡ እምዓረቢ፡ ለግዕዝ። በመዋዕለ፡ ንጉሥነ፡ መፍቀሬ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ገላውዴዎስ። እምአመ፡ ነግሠ፡ በ፲ወ፫ዓመት፡ ስብሐት፡ ለእግዚአብሔር: ወትረ፡ እስከ፡ ለዓለመ፡ ዓለም፡ አሜን።</t:ab>
                  <t:note>The embedded colophon is taken from <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/ESmakm004">ʾƎndartā, Māy ʾAnbasā Dabra Gannat Kidāna Mǝḥrat, MAKM-004, f. 91rb-va</t:ref>.</t:note>
               </t:div>
               
               
            </t:div>
         </t:div>
      </t:body>
   </t:text></TEI>